NOTE ON BUNDLED CONTENT

The MIT licence above covers the source code of this project.

It does NOT cover third-party material that ships alongside it:

  * Product photographs under `Products/` and any imagery served from the
    ShopiQ CDN are the property of their respective manufacturers and
    retailers. They are present for demonstration only and are not licensed
    for redistribution or reuse.

  * Brand names, product names, logos and trade marks referenced in the demo
    catalogue (Apple, Samsung, Sony, ASUS, Razorpay and others) belong to
    their respective owners. Their appearance here is nominative reference in
    a demonstration dataset and implies no affiliation or endorsement.

  * The demo catalogue in `data/catalog/catalog.json` is invented data:
    prices, ratings, stock levels and reviews are fabricated for demonstration
    and do not reflect any real product, price or seller.

If you fork this project for anything beyond local experimentation, replace
that material with content you have the right to use.
